1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:02,210
My mother is on a key ring.

2
00:00:02,410 --> 00:00:04,240
She came to me, you know.

3
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:05,630
Nine years ago.

4
00:00:05,680 --> 00:00:06,820
You're lying.

5
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:08,730
I came for you, Miss Reyes.

6
00:00:08,730 --> 00:00:11,020
You were fifteen,
and fast asleep.

7
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:12,860
She offered me a trade.

8
00:00:13,460 --> 00:00:14,820
So she hung up her coat.

9
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:15,780
She lit one word.

10
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:19,490
And she walked out into the
rain, so he would never come in.

11
00:00:20,090 --> 00:00:20,350
Mara.

12
00:00:20,350 --> 00:00:20,810
The sign.

13
00:00:20,810 --> 00:00:22,650
It wasn't telling you to wait.

14
00:00:22,950 --> 00:00:24,150
She was telling him.

15
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:27,460
All these years, I
thought she left me.

16
00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:30,890
I also died today, and
nobody has said sorry.

17
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:32,050
Sorry, Zip.

18
00:00:31,950 --> 00:00:33,360
Thank you. Continue.

19
00:00:33,870 --> 00:00:35,640
Trade me. Let her go.

20
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:36,490
Gladly.

21
00:00:36,490 --> 00:00:39,240
Be inside number
nine, at midnight.

22
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:40,010
Alone.

23
00:00:40,210 --> 00:00:41,190
She's never alone.

24
00:00:41,190 --> 00:00:42,410
I'm rechargeable.

25
00:00:42,710 --> 00:00:44,860
You have until midnight.

26
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:47,330
It was already eleven.
